      "content": "The weight of past sacrifices is a heavy burden, and it's understandable why you feel this pressure to uphold something so significant. However, your value as a person is separate from the achievements of your family line. A legacy isn't just about perfection; it can also be about how you navigate challenges and redefine what strength looks like in a new generation. You do not have to carry the weight of their expectations alone; perhaps redefining your own path is a way to honor them in a different way.",
      "source": "target",
