      "content": "It sounds like you are in intense pain, viewing yourself as irreparable damage, and that feeling of wanting to remove yourself seems like an escape. Please know that feeling like a problem is not the same as being a problem, and there are people who want to help you find a way through this. Your presence matters, and the thought of \"absence\" shouldn't be the only perceived solution to your pain. Reaching out to a crisis hotline immediately can connect you with someone who can support you right now.",
